h/blog/posts/copy-fail-2.html">https://afflicted.sh/blog/posts/copy-fail-2.=
html</a>=C2=A0</span><span></span><span><br>
      </span></p>
    <p><span><a class=3D"moz-txt-link-freetext" href=3D"https://github.com/=
0xdeadbeefnetwork/Copy_Fail2-Electric_Boogaloo">https://github.com/0xdeadbe=
efnetwork/Copy_Fail2-Electric_Boogaloo</a></span></p>
    <p><span><a class=3D"moz-txt-link-freetext" href=3D"https://git.kernel.=
